WEBVTT

00:16.433 --> 00:17.434
A virus, huh?

00:20.478 --> 00:21.604
[sighs]

00:21.688 --> 00:22.731
[suspenseful music playing]

00:22.814 --> 00:23.982
So you're telling me,

00:24.065 --> 00:27.569
that this whole mess started with a virus
made by a high school science teacher?

00:32.615 --> 00:33.908
This virus.

00:33.992 --> 00:36.661
Tell me why?
Why would you do something like this?

00:37.495 --> 00:38.455
Detective.

00:41.875 --> 00:43.376
Do you have any kids?

00:44.210 --> 00:45.920
[kids clamoring]

00:46.796 --> 00:49.382
[Hee-su whimpering]

00:51.050 --> 00:51.885
[straining]

00:52.635 --> 00:54.220
[sobbing]

00:57.223 --> 00:58.475
[sobbing]

01:00.185 --> 01:02.562
[sobbing continues]

01:03.688 --> 01:05.774
-[baby cries]
-[Hee-su crying]

01:06.399 --> 01:09.527
[baby crying]

01:09.611 --> 01:10.612
[breathing heavily]

01:11.112 --> 01:12.489
-[sniffles]
-[baby crying continues]

01:15.200 --> 01:16.451
[Hee-su whimpering]

01:34.135 --> 01:35.386
[lady] Yes, sweetheart.

01:37.639 --> 01:40.058
-[indistinct chattering]
-[kids shouting indistinctly]

01:40.141 --> 01:41.100
Yun-a.

01:41.184 --> 01:43.269
Oh, no. Be careful.

01:45.063 --> 01:46.564
You should watch where you're going.

01:49.567 --> 01:51.569
[Mr. Lee] Could you let your child die?

01:54.572 --> 01:56.616
No parent on Earth could do that.

01:56.699 --> 01:59.202
I don't wanna hear that bullshit.
Just answer the question.

02:00.954 --> 02:02.247
[Jae-ik] What is the virus and how--

02:02.330 --> 02:04.165
Jae-ik. Code red.

02:04.249 --> 02:06.751
Chief needs everyone right now.
Come on, hurry.

02:07.377 --> 02:08.628
It's too late.

02:11.673 --> 02:12.715
We're all dead.

02:13.675 --> 02:15.426
There's no hope for survival.

02:16.845 --> 02:17.720
[foreboding music playing]

02:20.014 --> 02:21.683
[breathes nervously]

02:26.855 --> 02:27.897
[screaming in distance]

02:31.401 --> 02:32.318
[grunts]

02:33.778 --> 02:34.696
[breathes heavily]

02:40.076 --> 02:41.119
Oh, shit.

02:41.202 --> 02:43.580
[breathes heavily]

02:46.249 --> 02:47.667
[zombies growling]

02:50.587 --> 02:52.046
[theme music playing]

03:10.648 --> 03:12.859
-[Cheong-san grunts]
-[growling]

03:16.362 --> 03:17.655
Cheong-san!

03:17.739 --> 03:19.324
Look down. Down, down, down.

03:19.407 --> 03:20.617
[growling]

03:20.700 --> 03:21.618
I know.

03:21.701 --> 03:23.953
She's got your foot, moron. Look!

03:24.037 --> 03:26.539
-[Cheong-san] I see that.
-Kick her off or something, idiot.

03:26.623 --> 03:27.916
[Cheong-san] I'm trying.

03:27.999 --> 03:30.043
[zombie growling]

03:31.377 --> 03:33.004
What the hell is it taking you so long?

03:33.713 --> 03:34.964
[zombie growling]

03:35.048 --> 03:36.382
[Cheong-san grunting]

03:38.051 --> 03:39.218
[gasps]

03:39.302 --> 03:40.553
Hey!

03:42.764 --> 03:44.349
Hey. I'm coming down.

03:45.767 --> 03:47.227
No, stay there.

03:47.310 --> 03:49.229
-[grunts]
-No. I said, don't do it.

03:49.812 --> 03:51.439
-I'm coming.
-Don't!

03:53.191 --> 03:55.068
-[Cheong-san] Stay there.
-[Su-hyeok] Oh, shit.

04:00.114 --> 04:00.949
[gasps]
Hold on.

04:02.784 --> 04:04.244
Hey, Bare-su, look up.

04:06.579 --> 04:08.665
[growling]

04:11.167 --> 04:12.377
[grunts]

04:13.044 --> 04:14.212
[both grunting, panting]

04:18.633 --> 04:20.677
[zombie growling]

04:22.387 --> 04:24.222
[groaning]
My back.

04:24.305 --> 04:26.766
Just stay still. I'm helping.

04:27.725 --> 04:28.559
[both grunting]

04:28.643 --> 04:30.270
[groans]
What are you doing?

04:31.271 --> 04:32.772
-Hold on, moron.
-[grunts]

04:34.107 --> 04:35.984
-[Su-hyeok grunting]
-[zombie growling]

04:39.404 --> 04:41.781
-Guys, look, Bare-su. Bare-su!
-Cheong-san!

04:43.074 --> 04:44.325
[zombie shrieks]

04:46.661 --> 04:48.329
Hang on, Bare-su!

04:48.413 --> 04:49.831
Are you okay?

04:49.914 --> 04:50.832
[panting]

04:50.915 --> 04:53.543
Shit. Why can't you just kick her…
[panting]

04:54.335 --> 04:55.461
…like I said?

04:56.045 --> 04:58.214
Hey. Stop hugging me.

04:59.549 --> 05:01.009
[Su-hyeok] I'm not hugging you.

05:02.051 --> 05:03.928
[both panting]

05:04.012 --> 05:05.179
Fuck off.

05:05.263 --> 05:06.347
[both laugh]

05:06.431 --> 05:07.473
You like it?

05:07.557 --> 05:08.808
[both laugh]

05:11.644 --> 05:12.979
-[Wu-jin] Are you okay?
-[Na-yeon] Close it.

05:13.062 --> 05:15.106
Close it before they get in!

05:16.274 --> 05:18.568
[grumbles, whines]
Would you just close it already?

05:18.651 --> 05:20.445
What's wrong with you?
Cheong-san still out there.

05:20.528 --> 05:21.946
You want us just to shut him out?

05:22.030 --> 05:24.240
Is it a crime to want the window close?

05:24.324 --> 05:25.825
How can you be so selfish?

05:25.908 --> 05:26.743
[sighs]

05:26.826 --> 05:28.328
I can't stand you, stupid welfie.

05:30.955 --> 05:32.206
[sighs]

05:33.624 --> 05:34.834
[yelps]

05:34.917 --> 05:36.961
-What did you just call me?
-Hey, come on.

05:37.045 --> 05:38.171
What's happening?

05:38.254 --> 05:40.089
-You just hit me?
-Yeah.

05:40.590 --> 05:41.716
Call me that again.

05:41.799 --> 05:43.926
Hey, knock it off.
What's going on over here, guys?

05:44.010 --> 05:45.303
He just hit me.

05:45.386 --> 05:47.096
Only 'cause you called me a welfie.

05:47.180 --> 05:49.974
-Is it not true?
-You just can't say shit like that.

05:50.892 --> 05:51.726
What's a welfie?

05:52.477 --> 05:53.478
[Ms. Park] Tell me.

05:54.062 --> 05:55.188
What is it?

05:58.107 --> 05:59.233
What's a welfie?

06:02.445 --> 06:03.821
A person on welfare.

06:04.655 --> 06:07.492
-What?
-It means, a person on welfare.

06:08.034 --> 06:09.911
"Welfie" for short.

06:10.578 --> 06:11.412
[sighs]

06:13.122 --> 06:13.956
[sighs]

06:14.665 --> 06:17.585
Na-yeon, that was wrong.
Don't ever say that again.

06:17.668 --> 06:18.753
And Gyeong-su.

06:18.836 --> 06:20.713
When you hit people,
you're the one who ends up losing.

06:20.797 --> 06:23.299
-Do you understand?
-No, I don't.

06:23.841 --> 06:26.219
Listen, we can't be fighting
each other in a moment like this.

06:26.302 --> 06:27.929
We don't know what's going on
out there with those--

06:28.012 --> 06:29.097
Are they zombies?

06:30.098 --> 06:31.390
What about the other teachers?

06:31.474 --> 06:33.059
Has anyone called the cops?

06:33.142 --> 06:35.269
Don't worry, I'm sure someone already has.

06:35.353 --> 06:36.979
I just don't have
my phone on me, right now.

06:37.063 --> 06:38.898
We called them, but they're not coming.

06:38.981 --> 06:41.567
Neither the police nor first responders.

06:41.651 --> 06:44.362
I'm sure they'll be here soon.
We just have to wait a little longer.

06:44.445 --> 06:47.115
Ms. Park. Hyeon-ju's hands were cold too.

06:47.865 --> 06:49.033
[On-jo] So were I-sak's.

06:49.534 --> 06:51.994
What if all of this started with Hyeon-ju?

06:52.078 --> 06:53.746
She went to the hospital.

06:53.830 --> 06:56.374
What if it spread in there as well?

06:56.457 --> 06:58.459
[Hyo-ryeong sighs]
Maybe that's why no one's coming.

06:58.543 --> 07:01.587
But wait. They still work, right?

07:01.671 --> 07:03.339
Uh, internet. The internet.

07:03.881 --> 07:05.633
-Let's see. Sorry, Ms. Park.
-Oh.

07:05.716 --> 07:07.385
-[Dae-su] Here. Sit.
-[Joon-yeong] Thanks.

07:08.469 --> 07:10.138
[Wu-jin] It should work. Is it on?

07:10.221 --> 07:11.305
[Joon-yeong] I think so.

07:11.889 --> 07:13.558
What's the problem?
Why is it not turning on?

07:13.641 --> 07:15.059
-It just did.
-Oh, sorry.

07:15.643 --> 07:17.562
[Joon-yeong sighs]
School ones are so slow.

07:20.148 --> 07:21.732
[Wu-jin] Maybe it's not online?

07:21.816 --> 07:23.192
[Joon-yeong] It must be.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.735
[Wu-jin sighs]
It's gonna take all day.

07:24.819 --> 07:26.112
[Ji-min] Is it still loading?

07:26.195 --> 07:28.114
-Su-hyeok, did you see it?
-[Wu-jin] I don't think it's working.

07:28.197 --> 07:29.157
What?

07:29.240 --> 07:30.366
In the science lab.

07:30.450 --> 07:31.659
[zombies growling]

07:34.162 --> 07:35.121
SU-HYEOK, WE'RE IN THE
BROADCASTING ROOM - NAM-RA

07:35.705 --> 07:37.331
Well, I was actually in the art room.

07:38.541 --> 07:40.042
-[boys chattering]
-What's in the science lab?

07:40.960 --> 07:42.587
Uh, well…

07:42.670 --> 07:44.255
-[computer chimes]
-[Joon-yeong] It worked.

07:45.006 --> 07:47.508
-Okay. Open the browser.
-[Dae-su] The browser.

07:47.592 --> 07:48.759
[computer whirring]

07:48.843 --> 07:50.678
[Dae-su] Look up "zombie virus."

07:50.761 --> 07:51.721
[window clanks]

07:51.804 --> 07:53.181
-[Wu-jin] Yeah, "zombie virus."
-[Ji-min] But…

07:53.264 --> 07:55.683
-[Hyo-ryeong] No. Try "Hyosan."
-[Ji-min] See what's trending.

07:55.766 --> 07:57.018
-[Joon-yeong] No.
-[Ji-min sighs in annoyance]

07:57.101 --> 07:58.936
-I'm checking the news first.
-Look up the emergence alerts.

07:59.020 --> 08:00.271
-[Wu-jin] The news.
-[Dae-su] There'll be no articles yet.

08:00.354 --> 08:02.356
-[Cheong-san] Yeah, go to the news.
-[Hyo-ryeong] What are we looking up?

08:03.983 --> 08:04.859
[brake squeals]

08:05.943 --> 08:06.903
[woman 1] See you later.

08:10.323 --> 08:11.616
[car whooshes]

08:13.117 --> 08:14.285
[tires screeching]

08:15.119 --> 08:16.037
[car honking]

08:20.124 --> 08:21.334
[tire whirring]

08:23.044 --> 08:25.171
-Are you okay? Let me help you.
-Come on.

08:25.254 --> 08:26.589
Stand up. Can you stand?

08:27.965 --> 08:30.801
-[woman 2] Call an ambulance.
-[man 1] Let's get out of the way first.

08:30.885 --> 08:32.220
-See that?
-What's going on?

08:32.303 --> 08:33.554
[police officer 1 grunting]

08:34.722 --> 08:36.641
-[breathing heavily, gasping]
-[retches]

08:37.141 --> 08:39.977
Sir, are you all right? Do you need help?

08:40.686 --> 08:42.271
-[zombie snarls]
-[man 2 screaming]

08:42.355 --> 08:43.564
[tense music playing]

08:43.648 --> 08:45.066
-[zombie growling]
-[screaming]

08:46.359 --> 08:47.527
[munching, growling]

08:48.653 --> 08:50.238
[whimpering]

08:50.321 --> 08:51.155
[growls]

08:54.242 --> 08:55.618
Oh, shit.

08:55.701 --> 08:56.744
[pants]

08:57.662 --> 08:59.330
[growling]

08:59.914 --> 09:00.748
[snarls]

09:01.916 --> 09:03.918
[growls, screams]

09:04.460 --> 09:05.878
[groans]

09:05.962 --> 09:06.921
No. No, please!

09:07.838 --> 09:08.965
[breathing heavily]

09:12.760 --> 09:14.679
[breathing heavily]

09:16.222 --> 09:17.723
[growls]

09:18.432 --> 09:19.725
[grunting]

09:22.019 --> 09:23.437
[clamoring]

09:25.231 --> 09:27.525
[screaming in distance]

09:29.735 --> 09:30.611
I'll try Facebook.

09:33.155 --> 09:33.990
[keyboard clacking]

09:34.073 --> 09:35.408
Or Instagram.

09:35.491 --> 09:36.867
Do you have followers?

09:36.951 --> 09:38.119
Let's do Facebook.

09:38.744 --> 09:39.954
Hmm…

09:43.124 --> 09:44.750
-[notification chimes]
-Okay.

09:45.334 --> 09:47.003
How many friends do you have?

09:47.086 --> 09:49.088
[Dae-su] Look at your notifications.1,700?

09:50.298 --> 09:51.674
Strange.

09:53.718 --> 09:54.885
Okay, let's check messages first.

09:56.220 --> 09:57.930
[all clamoring]

09:58.764 --> 10:00.391
-[Joon-yeong] What the hell?
-Oh, shit.

10:00.474 --> 10:01.475
[suspenseful music playing]

10:01.559 --> 10:02.810
[groaning]

10:02.893 --> 10:04.604
-[Joon-yeong] What was that?
-[flustered murmur]

10:04.687 --> 10:05.813
[Ms. Park] Get over here. Come here.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.566
Did someone not make it in?

10:09.692 --> 10:11.110
No. No one.

10:13.696 --> 10:14.905
Wait. Don't go too close!

10:14.989 --> 10:15.990
Cheong-san.

10:16.824 --> 10:17.908
Be careful.

10:18.576 --> 10:20.286
[glass shattering]

10:24.415 --> 10:25.583
Do you see anything?

10:31.839 --> 10:33.007
It's just the wind.

10:33.716 --> 10:34.800
[Wu-jin] That scared me.

10:35.301 --> 10:37.511
-[growls]
-[all gasps, clamoring]

10:37.595 --> 10:39.096
[screaming]

10:40.514 --> 10:42.141
Look, it's coming in!
Watch out, watch out!

10:42.725 --> 10:43.601
[zombie growling]

10:44.101 --> 10:46.020
Cheong-san, get back. Get back here.

10:46.103 --> 10:46.979
[snarling]

10:47.063 --> 10:48.522
[Gyeong-su] Look out, look out!

10:50.066 --> 10:51.108
[Ms. Park] Cheong-san!

10:52.109 --> 10:53.736
-Cheong-san!
-Get back here!

10:53.819 --> 10:55.029
[Dae-su] Wait. w-w-wait, wait!

10:55.112 --> 10:56.739
-[growling]
-[grunts]

10:56.822 --> 10:59.241
-[Su-hyeok] Push it! Push it off.
-[Dae-su] Did you get it?

10:59.325 --> 11:00.368
-[zombie growling]
-Push it!

11:00.451 --> 11:01.535
-[grunts]
-[Gyeong-su] Push it off.

11:03.079 --> 11:04.830
[Gyeong-su] Push it off!

11:05.998 --> 11:07.166
[Gyeong-su] Push it! Come on.

11:07.792 --> 11:08.959
Go! Harder!

11:09.043 --> 11:10.252
[growling]

11:11.879 --> 11:13.130
-Watch out!
-Remove her hand!

11:14.715 --> 11:16.175
[groaning]
Shit!

11:16.967 --> 11:18.302
-[screaming]
-Stay back!

11:22.264 --> 11:23.474
-[grunts]
-[all gasp]

11:26.018 --> 11:27.269
[zombie growling]

11:28.354 --> 11:29.563
[zombie snarling]

11:32.441 --> 11:33.818
[Na-yeon] Don't go near it!

11:35.361 --> 11:36.612
-Should I go?
-Stay back.

11:36.695 --> 11:38.447
No. Hold on.

11:38.531 --> 11:39.824
-[Su-hyeok] Go, Dae-su.
-[growls]

11:39.907 --> 11:40.908
[snarling]

11:42.660 --> 11:43.994
-Give me.
-[growling]

11:44.954 --> 11:46.122
[grunts]

11:47.915 --> 11:50.000
[breathing heavily]

11:54.422 --> 11:55.673
[growling]

11:56.799 --> 11:57.883
[snarls]

11:59.009 --> 12:00.052
-[growling]
-[grunting]

12:02.096 --> 12:03.139
Shit. We're completely fucked.

12:04.014 --> 12:05.349
[Cheong-san] Just push it!

12:05.433 --> 12:06.809
[Joon-yeong] Push it! Push it off!

12:07.435 --> 12:09.145
[whimpering]
Push it away already!

12:10.104 --> 12:12.440
-[Dae-su] It's coming in.
-Su-hyeok! Watch out for your hand!

12:13.566 --> 12:15.192
Su-hyeok! Fuck it!

12:15.776 --> 12:16.777
[screaming]

12:18.112 --> 12:19.822
[all clamoring]

12:20.614 --> 12:21.657
Is it gone?

12:22.992 --> 12:23.868
[thuds]

12:23.951 --> 12:25.202
[growling]

12:26.954 --> 12:27.788
[snarls]

12:30.708 --> 12:32.501
[Dae-su sighs in relief]
That was crazy.

12:33.419 --> 12:34.753
I'm so dead.

12:34.837 --> 12:35.921
[sighs]

12:36.005 --> 12:38.090
-[Cheong-san] Are you okay?
-[Gyeong-su] Yeah, I'm good.

12:40.593 --> 12:41.552
[Wu-jin] Where did it come from?

12:43.429 --> 12:46.223
-Hey, you good?
-That was scary. I'm good.

12:50.603 --> 12:51.645
Hey.

12:52.813 --> 12:53.647
[Na-yeon] You…

12:58.027 --> 12:59.737
RESCUE

12:59.820 --> 13:02.698
HYOSAN CITY COUNCIL

13:03.741 --> 13:04.617
[groaning]

13:05.784 --> 13:08.370
You have to understand
he's the youngest aide we have.

13:08.454 --> 13:11.582
When he got back from the Council building
he just collapsed and started convulsing.

13:11.665 --> 13:15.586
-[croaks]
-Captain. He smells like a rotting corpse.

13:15.669 --> 13:17.463
And then he got back up, and went like…

13:17.546 --> 13:18.380
[imitates growling]

13:18.464 --> 13:20.633
…and just attacked Assemblywoman
out of nowhere.

13:20.716 --> 13:22.259
[sighs]
So we tied him up to that chair.

13:22.343 --> 13:24.845
But we didn't know
if we should call the police. You know?

13:24.929 --> 13:26.013
Why are you telling them that?

13:26.764 --> 13:28.265
-[croaks]
-He'll bite his tongue.

13:29.099 --> 13:30.726
-We have to gag him.
-Copy.

13:34.396 --> 13:35.272
[growls]

13:35.356 --> 13:36.482
-Ready?
-Yes.

13:36.982 --> 13:39.401
One, two, three.

13:39.485 --> 13:40.653
[growling]

13:41.904 --> 13:42.780
[grunts]

13:42.863 --> 13:45.199
-Did it get you?
-It's okay. A little.

13:45.282 --> 13:46.283
Wrap him up!

13:47.326 --> 13:48.160
Now.

13:48.953 --> 13:50.663
-[muffled growls]
-[grunting]

13:53.457 --> 13:55.125
[male dispatcher]
Message from headquarters. Come in.

13:57.711 --> 13:59.547
-Rescue Team One.
-[cellphones ringing]

13:59.630 --> 14:01.423
[male dispatcher]
Level-three disaster in Hyosan.

14:02.341 --> 14:04.218
Report to temporary headquarters.

14:04.301 --> 14:06.136
Did you say level-three disaster?

14:06.637 --> 14:07.680
[male dispatcher] I repeat.

14:07.763 --> 14:10.307
Level-three disaster in Hyosan.

14:10.391 --> 14:12.309
Report to temporary headquarters.

14:12.893 --> 14:13.727
What is it?

14:13.811 --> 14:15.437
-This is the director's order.
-Where are they sending you?

14:15.521 --> 14:17.690
-Mobilize immediately. That is all.
-Uh…

14:18.357 --> 14:19.567
The fire department headquarters

14:19.650 --> 14:21.944
was moved out of the city
for an emergency.

14:22.486 --> 14:25.531
The Disaster and Safety Control
will manage the situation.

14:25.614 --> 14:27.199
Is evacuation really necessary?

14:28.534 --> 14:30.703
All right. All right, all right. Hang on.

14:32.037 --> 14:35.082
Okay, so they think
it's an acute infection.

14:35.666 --> 14:38.377
They're saying there will be
an evacuation order for Hyosan soon.

14:40.379 --> 14:42.756
Gyeong-su, you're bleeding.

14:43.799 --> 14:44.717
I am?

14:47.636 --> 14:48.971
[scoffs]
Right, it's because

14:49.054 --> 14:50.890
Su-hyeok hit me with a fucking mop.

14:50.973 --> 14:53.350
[breathes shakily]
Stay back. Stay where you are.

14:53.434 --> 14:55.227
You were bitten, weren't you, Gyeong-su?

14:55.311 --> 14:56.687
I wasn't. I wasn't.

14:56.770 --> 14:57.980
Didn't you see Su-hyeok hit me?

14:59.148 --> 15:00.065
[gasps]

15:01.066 --> 15:02.902
What is your fucking problem with me?

15:02.985 --> 15:04.361
You were bitten!

15:04.445 --> 15:05.738
[scoffs]

15:06.488 --> 15:08.949
I-sak got a nosebleed
just before she turned.

15:09.033 --> 15:10.784
On-jo. You saw it, right?

15:10.868 --> 15:13.120
[Na-yeon] That's the same thing
that happened to I-sak.

15:13.203 --> 15:14.413
Gyeong-su.

15:14.496 --> 15:16.624
[splutters]
I-I'm telling you! I swear I wasn't bit!

15:20.252 --> 15:21.670
[sighs in annoyance]
Shit.

15:21.754 --> 15:23.130
Look.

15:23.213 --> 15:25.633
Your hand. Explain that?

15:25.716 --> 15:27.051
What is it?

15:28.969 --> 15:31.055
I got it from the computer.
Didn't you see that?

15:31.138 --> 15:32.014
[all gasp]

15:33.474 --> 15:34.516
[scoffs]

15:34.600 --> 15:35.768
Don't you trust me?

15:36.727 --> 15:39.980
I can't believe this.
I got this trying to save all of you.

15:41.106 --> 15:41.941
[Gyeong-su hisses]

15:46.612 --> 15:48.697
It's not a bite. It's a scratch.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.075
Whoever wants to check, come look.

15:53.202 --> 15:54.411
[Dae-su] It's a scratch?

15:55.412 --> 15:57.831
Yeah, definitely. Just a scratch.

15:58.415 --> 16:00.000
-Ms. Park, look.
-Mm.

16:01.543 --> 16:04.505
Well, it really doesn't look like a bite.
Thank god. It's a scratch.

16:04.588 --> 16:06.090
He's okay.

16:10.803 --> 16:11.720
Done yet?

16:12.805 --> 16:14.473
I said, are you done with me now?

16:15.557 --> 16:19.186
Wait. This means the computer's gone.

16:19.269 --> 16:20.396
No internet…

16:21.647 --> 16:23.816
Couldn't you have thrown something else
instead of the computer?

16:23.899 --> 16:25.859
What was I supposed to do?
It's trying to get in.

16:26.485 --> 16:29.780
No, you did good. Thank you. Don't be mad.

16:30.781 --> 16:32.074
Hey, Na-yeon.

16:32.157 --> 16:34.576
Look. Say sorry. End this.

16:35.160 --> 16:36.412
Why should I?

16:36.495 --> 16:38.372
[scoffs]
He did it to save us all.

16:38.455 --> 16:40.040
Why can't you just say that you're sorry?

16:40.124 --> 16:41.625
Because I'm not sorry.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.003
I saw everything.

16:44.086 --> 16:45.295
I saw the creature grabbed you.

16:45.379 --> 16:46.672
[zombie growling]

16:48.716 --> 16:50.009
[Na-yeon] I'm right.

16:50.676 --> 16:51.844
He could be infected.

16:51.927 --> 16:53.387
Na-yeon, enough.

16:53.470 --> 16:55.556
It really did.
That thing grabbed his hand.

16:56.557 --> 16:58.642
Wait, can touching his hand infect him?

16:58.726 --> 17:00.185
I have no idea but maybe.

17:00.269 --> 17:02.312
I held I-sak's hand when she fell.

17:03.063 --> 17:04.148
Why is nothing happening to me?

17:04.231 --> 17:06.025
Because he has a cut on his hand.

17:06.108 --> 17:08.610
And since there's an open wound,
it's probably gonna be different.

17:08.694 --> 17:09.987
-That's fucking--
-Don't.

17:10.070 --> 17:12.698
Stop blaming me.
Why don't you just think for yourselves?

17:12.781 --> 17:13.615
[Gyeong-su sighs]

17:14.324 --> 17:15.242
Na-yeon.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.495
I know you always hated Gyeong-su,

17:18.579 --> 17:20.622
but I think you're really crossing
the line here.

17:20.706 --> 17:22.332
This is about life and death.

17:22.416 --> 17:23.751
She's always like this.

17:24.251 --> 17:25.210
[scoffs]

17:25.294 --> 17:28.088
If it weren't for him,
we would definitely all be dead right now.

17:28.172 --> 17:30.466
And now, he might be the one
killing all of us.

17:30.549 --> 17:32.259
Now you're the one who's killing me.

17:32.342 --> 17:33.761
-Just shut up, Na-yeon.
-Look at my hand, I'm totally fine.

17:33.844 --> 17:35.679
-Don't you see that?
-Hey, that's enough, all of you! Okay?

17:35.763 --> 17:36.597
We're ending this.

17:36.680 --> 17:37.890
-Ms. Park--
-Enough.

17:37.973 --> 17:38.932
-But she--
-No!

17:40.559 --> 17:41.727
[sighs]

17:46.148 --> 17:47.066
[sighs]

17:48.567 --> 17:49.651
Let's do this.

17:50.444 --> 17:53.697
Gyeong-su, you're going to wait
in the recording room for ten minutes.

17:53.781 --> 17:54.990
I know it'll be hard,

17:55.074 --> 17:57.242
but at least it's better
than people thinking you're infected.

17:57.326 --> 18:00.496
No one else thinks that I'm infected.
It's only her.

18:00.579 --> 18:03.373
Gyeong-su, would you please do it?

18:05.751 --> 18:07.544
Fuck ten. I'll do half…

18:08.045 --> 18:09.546
I'll just do a full hour.

18:09.630 --> 18:13.008
There's really no point doing an hour
since it takes less than five minutes.

18:13.092 --> 18:14.760
-Stop overreacting.
-It's just to be sure.

18:16.428 --> 18:17.513
[Ms. Park] Is that enough?

18:19.056 --> 18:21.433
And if nothing happens,
you'll apologize, right?

18:23.477 --> 18:24.353
Yeah.

18:25.646 --> 18:28.482
And everyone else
is okay with that, right?

18:28.565 --> 18:29.775
[all] Yes.

18:30.692 --> 18:33.403
If we do this,
who's gonna step up next time?

18:33.487 --> 18:34.822
We all be too scared.

18:36.073 --> 18:37.449
You're right, but…

18:40.869 --> 18:43.831
Let's consider this a way
to learn to trust each other.

18:46.333 --> 18:49.169
I do… trust Gyeong-su.

18:53.757 --> 18:54.925
See you in an hour.

18:56.802 --> 18:58.053
Want me to come with you?

19:08.647 --> 19:10.065
[Dae-su] What a stubborn asshole.

19:10.941 --> 19:12.234
He only needs to do ten.

19:12.317 --> 19:13.610
He's not that stubborn.

19:14.278 --> 19:15.404
Compared to her.

19:15.487 --> 19:16.864
[sighs]

19:22.953 --> 19:24.746
[foreboding music playing]

19:31.336 --> 19:32.796
[zombies growling in distance]

19:35.674 --> 19:38.010
-Go get it.
-No. I won't.

19:38.093 --> 19:39.094
You stupid little…

19:39.595 --> 19:40.470
Stop. Please.

19:40.554 --> 19:42.139
-Go, asshole.
-[grunts]

19:42.723 --> 19:44.308
-[whimpers]
-[zombies growling]

19:44.391 --> 19:46.768
Move. Please don't.

19:48.770 --> 19:50.480
-[yelps]
-[zombie growling]

19:50.564 --> 19:51.690
[Gwi-nam whimpering]

19:53.734 --> 19:55.277
[hissing, growls]

19:58.780 --> 19:59.990
[whimpers]

20:02.492 --> 20:03.744
[growling]

20:04.578 --> 20:06.121
[whimpers, breathes heavily]

20:06.663 --> 20:07.581
[shrieks]

20:14.546 --> 20:16.840
Hey, kid. Down here. Come.

20:16.924 --> 20:18.425
[zombie growling]

20:19.384 --> 20:20.636
[grunts]

20:20.719 --> 20:21.762
-[yelps]
-[munching]

20:21.845 --> 20:24.097
-[grunting]
-[screaming]

20:24.598 --> 20:26.475
[panting]

20:29.019 --> 20:29.937
[gasps, whimpers]

20:31.021 --> 20:32.731
[grunts]

20:39.279 --> 20:40.280
[growling]

20:47.079 --> 20:47.996
Fuck.

20:52.584 --> 20:53.877
[grunts]

20:57.923 --> 20:59.549
[screams]

20:59.633 --> 21:00.884
[knife rasps]

21:05.264 --> 21:06.890
[breathes shakily]

21:14.064 --> 21:15.023
[growling]

21:15.816 --> 21:16.942
[grunts]

21:17.025 --> 21:18.986
HYOSAN HIGH SCHOOL

21:19.069 --> 21:20.904
[Wu-jin] Maybe they're drawn to smell.

21:20.988 --> 21:23.323
-They do always go after you.
-[Dae-su sighs]

21:23.407 --> 21:24.324
I don't smell.

21:24.992 --> 21:26.827
You sweat a lot, Dae-su.

21:26.910 --> 21:28.537
I sweat, but I don't smell.

21:29.454 --> 21:31.164
[Dae-su sniffs]
What's that smell?

21:31.832 --> 21:33.166
-Your sweat.
-[Dae-su sniffs]

21:34.418 --> 21:37.921
I think they're more sensitive
to sound than smell.

21:38.005 --> 21:39.798
-Sound?
-Yeah, sound.

21:40.340 --> 21:41.883
This isn't a movie.

21:42.843 --> 21:45.095
That's just how zombies are, you know?

21:45.178 --> 21:46.888
And didn't you see their eyes?

21:46.972 --> 21:48.890
They can't see with those eyes.

21:49.558 --> 21:51.560
-Ms. Park.
-Hmm?

21:51.643 --> 21:53.854
[Joon-yeong] Sound, smell, I don't know.

21:53.937 --> 21:55.856
Some kids probably left school, right?

21:56.815 --> 21:57.899
[Dae-su] It's sound.

21:57.983 --> 22:00.277
Mm-hm. Yeah, I think so.

22:01.236 --> 22:02.404
[Dae-su] Here, Su-hyeok.

22:02.487 --> 22:04.406
-[Ji-min] Give me the mirror.
-[breathes heavily]

22:04.489 --> 22:06.825
Maybe we're the lucky ones then?

22:07.909 --> 22:10.287
[boys chattering]

22:10.829 --> 22:12.956
The fact that we're alive

22:14.291 --> 22:15.459
makes us lucky.

22:17.919 --> 22:19.087
Really?

22:20.589 --> 22:21.423
Mm-hm.

22:22.174 --> 22:23.258
[Wu-jin] Wipe your face.

22:24.468 --> 22:25.427
[sniffles]

22:25.927 --> 22:27.512
[somber music playing]

22:28.764 --> 22:30.140
[sneezes, exhales]

22:55.165 --> 22:56.500
Are you okay?

22:58.001 --> 22:59.419
I keep thinking about I-sak.

23:00.337 --> 23:01.338
You held on…

23:02.422 --> 23:04.174
until the last possible second.

23:06.301 --> 23:08.970
Stop. That doesn't help.

23:10.097 --> 23:11.681
You didn't do anything wrong.

23:13.850 --> 23:14.893
Stay strong.

23:16.561 --> 23:18.063
Your dad or someone else…

23:20.065 --> 23:21.191
will come save us.

23:28.824 --> 23:32.536
FRIED CHICKEN RESTAURANT
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN

23:32.619 --> 23:35.122
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN
CHICKEN AND BEER

23:35.872 --> 23:37.332
[Cheong-san's dad]
Oh, for heaven's sake.

23:37.916 --> 23:41.545
Do you have to put
your son's face on the sign?

23:42.129 --> 23:43.755
Is there something wrong
with using his face?

23:44.506 --> 23:47.092
You'll end up becoming
an evil mother-in-law.

23:47.175 --> 23:49.302
All protective of your precious son.

23:49.386 --> 23:51.763
Nagged your daughter-in-law constantly.

23:51.847 --> 23:52.806
[laughs]

23:55.767 --> 23:57.269
Anyway, uh…

23:58.103 --> 24:00.981
better go submit these forms.
[chuckles]

24:01.606 --> 24:02.482
[grumbles]

24:05.652 --> 24:06.486
[chuckles softly]

24:08.905 --> 24:12.159
[anchorwoman] The series of incidents
occurring in Hyosan

24:12.242 --> 24:16.329
appear to be due to a mass outbreak
of a highly infectious virus.

24:16.413 --> 24:19.666
We'll speak to the
Disease Control Center for more details.

24:19.749 --> 24:23.170
Director Cha Hyeon-seok,
can you tell us what's going on?

24:23.253 --> 24:24.838
Considering the level of spread,

24:24.921 --> 24:27.674
it appears to be
a highly infectious disease.

24:27.757 --> 24:30.719
[Hyeon-seok] Those infected
became unusually aggressive.

24:30.802 --> 24:33.138
Victims showed similar symptoms,

24:33.221 --> 24:36.016
so we suspect secondary infection
is possible.

24:36.808 --> 24:39.060
As you've heard, this is very dangerous.

24:39.144 --> 24:41.104
[anchorwoman] As advised by the KDCA,

24:41.188 --> 24:44.816
the government has raised
the infectious disease alert to "serious."

24:44.900 --> 24:46.735
They stated that
they will do everything possible

24:46.818 --> 24:48.987
to prevent the spreading
outside of Hyosan.

24:49.070 --> 24:51.072
-[phone ringing]
-Breaking news. Just in.

24:51.156 --> 24:53.575
The National Security Council
has officially declared

24:53.658 --> 24:57.662
an evacuation order in place
for Hyosan City in Gyeonggi Province.

24:57.746 --> 25:00.332
If you are watching this, please be aware.

25:00.415 --> 25:03.376
You are under evacuation.
Please leave the city immediately.

25:03.460 --> 25:06.004
I repeat. The situation
is extremely serious.

25:06.087 --> 25:08.423
The National Security Council has decided

25:08.506 --> 25:12.928
to issue an evacuation order for the city
of Hyosan in Gyeonggi province.

25:13.011 --> 25:13.929
If you're watching this,

25:14.012 --> 25:17.724
please evacuate the city.
The situation is extremely dangerous.

25:20.602 --> 25:23.688
Hey, I'm just going
to step out for a minute.

25:23.772 --> 25:24.606
Okay.

25:24.689 --> 25:26.816
[engine starts, revs]

25:26.900 --> 25:28.235
[yelps, grunts]

25:28.318 --> 25:29.402
Are you all right?

25:29.486 --> 25:31.488
Yeah, yeah. I'm fine.

25:33.281 --> 25:35.492
[groans, breathes heavily]

25:35.575 --> 25:37.702
-l should be back soon.
-[engine starts]

25:37.786 --> 25:39.329
[engine revving]

25:41.539 --> 25:42.832
A virus?

25:43.708 --> 25:44.709
What kind of virus?

25:45.460 --> 25:48.505
[Seong-man] I don't think it's airborne,
but it hasn't been confirmed.

25:49.047 --> 25:51.925
It seems like you
get infected if you get bit,

25:52.008 --> 25:54.427
so don't get bit or make physical contact.

25:55.136 --> 25:58.640
We don't know
how much about the virus yet,

25:59.140 --> 26:00.934
so just avoid as much as you can.

26:02.018 --> 26:04.312
I hear an assembly member is there.

26:04.396 --> 26:06.106
-[U-sin] Hold still.
-[Seong-man] Who is it?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.483
[tense music playing]

26:09.442 --> 26:10.735
[U-sin] Yeong-hwan.

26:11.319 --> 26:12.237
[retches]

26:13.280 --> 26:14.531
What the…

26:15.031 --> 26:16.658
[gurgling]

26:16.741 --> 26:18.827
Yeong-hwan, hey, are you okay?

26:20.287 --> 26:22.038
-Captain, what do I do?
-[Yeong-hwan panting]

26:23.456 --> 26:24.749
-Yeong-hwan!
-[snarls]

26:25.667 --> 26:26.668
[U-sin] Yeong-hwan.

26:26.751 --> 26:29.671
That, that, that's exactly what happened
to our aide, I'm telling you.

26:32.173 --> 26:33.341
[Dal-ho] It's the same thing.

26:34.634 --> 26:36.636
-[all gasp]
-Oh, shit.

26:38.305 --> 26:39.472
Is he dead?

26:39.556 --> 26:40.765
[growling]

26:40.849 --> 26:42.142
[all clamoring]

26:45.145 --> 26:46.521
[snarls]

26:49.482 --> 26:50.483
[U-sin screaming]

26:50.567 --> 26:51.651
[So-ju grunting]

26:56.072 --> 26:57.657
U-sin!

26:57.741 --> 26:58.658
Rope!

26:59.159 --> 27:00.744
-Hurry!
-[Dal-ho] Tie him up!

27:00.827 --> 27:02.162
-[growling]
-[grunting]

27:04.205 --> 27:06.541
Tie him up! Now!

27:08.251 --> 27:11.212
[police dispatcher] Approximately
200 infected at Hyosan Intersection.

27:11.296 --> 27:14.341
Unit 1030, 1040, 1050.

27:14.424 --> 27:16.384
Move to Hyosan Intersection.

27:17.761 --> 27:19.637
[police officer 2] Copy that.
This is Unit 1030.

27:19.721 --> 27:21.389
Heading to Hyosan Intersection.

27:28.313 --> 27:29.522
[breathing shakily]

27:30.523 --> 27:31.816
[shuddering]

27:33.568 --> 27:35.528
[zombies growling]

27:44.996 --> 27:46.039
[growling]

27:52.337 --> 27:53.838
[growling]

27:58.009 --> 27:59.260
[growling]

28:00.470 --> 28:01.763
[munching]

28:03.807 --> 28:05.392
[police officer 3] Brace for impact!

28:11.523 --> 28:12.565
[growling]

28:16.069 --> 28:17.487
Go join the line!

28:19.197 --> 28:20.365
[growling]

28:24.577 --> 28:26.037
Block them!

28:30.917 --> 28:31.793
Stand firm!

28:35.797 --> 28:37.340
[police officer 4] Join the line!

28:39.801 --> 28:40.718
Hey!

28:41.553 --> 28:42.387
[brake squeals]

28:43.847 --> 28:45.473
Stop! Stop wait.

28:46.558 --> 28:48.852
-Turn around. You can't go through there.
-I'll be fast. I need to get through.

28:48.935 --> 28:49.936
What's going on?

28:50.019 --> 28:51.563
She says she needs to get through, sir.

28:52.313 --> 28:53.815
Ma'am, you have to turn back.

28:53.898 --> 28:55.567
-But my son--
-You need to evacuate.

28:56.151 --> 28:57.569
-Get her out.
-Yes, sir.

28:57.652 --> 28:59.320
-No. Wait.
-Come on. Let's go.

28:59.404 --> 29:00.447
-You need to leave.
-Lady, please.

29:00.530 --> 29:03.241
-Wait. My son, Cheong-san. Wait, please.
-Come on. Let's go.

29:04.868 --> 29:06.161
[engine starts]

29:08.830 --> 29:10.081
[engine revving]

29:11.875 --> 29:13.710
[rhythmic suspenseful music playing]

29:25.513 --> 29:27.265
-[gasps]
-[screams]

29:29.851 --> 29:31.519
[Cheong-san's mom grunting]

29:35.982 --> 29:38.610
You go to Hyosan High?
What are you doing here?

29:39.569 --> 29:41.362
Is the school okay?

29:41.446 --> 29:44.324
Hey. Wait.
Do you know my son, Cheong-san?

29:44.407 --> 29:45.909
Lee Cheong-san? Do you know him?

29:45.992 --> 29:47.368
[zombies growling in distance]

29:49.746 --> 29:51.498
[growling]

29:52.957 --> 29:54.209
[breathing heavily]

29:55.710 --> 29:56.669
Oh, no.

29:57.378 --> 29:58.421
[grunts]

29:58.505 --> 29:59.714
[breathing heavily]

30:00.507 --> 30:02.175
-[grunting]
-[zombies growling]

30:06.054 --> 30:07.889
[Mi-jin] Hey. Lift me higher.

30:07.972 --> 30:09.724
[Joon-seong stutters]
I can't go any higher.

30:09.808 --> 30:11.184
[Mi-jin] Stand on your toes.

30:11.267 --> 30:12.685
[Joon-seong] I am.

30:12.769 --> 30:14.395
[Min-jae] Do you see anything?

30:15.563 --> 30:18.566
Oh, shit.
There's a lot of zombies out there.

30:19.859 --> 30:21.319
-[Ha-ri] Put me down.
-[Min-jae] Okay.

30:21.945 --> 30:23.154
[Ha-ri] Be careful. Careful.

30:23.238 --> 30:24.656
[Min-jae grunts]
Okay.

30:24.739 --> 30:26.783
[Mi-jin grunts]
Why is this so hard?

30:26.866 --> 30:27.742
Are you okay?

30:28.284 --> 30:29.536
[Min-jae pants]
I'm okay.

30:30.495 --> 30:31.454
[groans]

30:31.955 --> 30:33.248
What do we do?

30:34.207 --> 30:35.667
Well, first…

30:36.709 --> 30:39.462
-You got a cigarette?
-No, I don't smoke.

30:39.546 --> 30:41.631
[sighs in annoyance]
Shit, you look like you do.

30:42.131 --> 30:43.925
[Mi-jin] Hey, What about you?

30:44.467 --> 30:45.760
I don't smoke.

30:45.844 --> 30:48.513
-Don't mess with me.
-I don't.

30:48.596 --> 30:50.557
Why are you being rude to upperclassman?

30:50.640 --> 30:52.141
-[Min-jae sighs]
-Wanna die?

30:53.142 --> 30:54.769
What the hell do you want?

30:54.853 --> 30:58.273
Hey. Who said you can talk like that
to an upperclassman?

30:58.857 --> 30:59.816
[sighs]

31:05.655 --> 31:06.823
-Sorry.
-No.

31:07.824 --> 31:09.284
To me, not to her.

31:10.326 --> 31:13.746
God, why are athletes
always such douchebags?

31:14.414 --> 31:15.874
Watch your mouth.

31:15.957 --> 31:16.916
Watch yourself.

31:17.000 --> 31:19.252
You're really going
to fight over these now, huh?

31:19.335 --> 31:21.713
What are you, stupid?
Just get along already.

31:24.424 --> 31:25.341
I'm sorry.

31:25.842 --> 31:27.635
I said I was sorry, okay?

31:27.719 --> 31:28.845
We got to go.

31:28.928 --> 31:30.305
[Joon-seong] How can we leave?

31:30.889 --> 31:33.057
If they see us,
they're gonna attack us all.

31:33.141 --> 31:34.976
[sighs]
If you wanna leave, go ahead.

31:35.059 --> 31:36.102
I'm not going.

31:37.228 --> 31:39.105
-You?
-Leave me alone.

31:39.188 --> 31:40.607
I do whatever I feel like.

31:42.066 --> 31:43.735
Heartless bitch.

31:46.112 --> 31:47.572
Here. Make weapons.

31:47.655 --> 31:48.656
[grumbles]

31:48.740 --> 31:49.741
Come on.

31:51.159 --> 31:52.327
[Mi-jin] Give me that.

31:56.247 --> 31:57.540
[knocks on door]

32:04.797 --> 32:08.509
[whistles to the tune of "Auld Lang Syne"]

32:09.636 --> 32:11.971
[whistles to the tune of "Auld Lang Syne"]

32:20.355 --> 32:22.065
[laughs]
Freak.

32:22.607 --> 32:23.650
[mouthing]
Han Gyeong-su.

32:24.692 --> 32:26.402
[mouthing]
I'll kill you.

32:39.666 --> 32:40.833
[laughs]

32:40.917 --> 32:42.543
What a fucking idiot.

32:43.670 --> 32:44.879
[Gyeong-su] What are you doing?

32:47.757 --> 32:48.925
[mouthing]
Thirty minutes.

32:50.885 --> 32:51.761
What's that?

32:51.844 --> 32:54.013
[mouthing]
It's been 30 minutes. Come out.

33:06.734 --> 33:10.238
Ms. Park. It's been more than 30 minutes,
but he still doesn't want to come out.

33:10.822 --> 33:12.865
[sighs]
I'll see what I can do.

33:13.700 --> 33:15.159
[door opens]

33:15.243 --> 33:16.536
What's wrong with him?

33:16.619 --> 33:17.578
[door closes]

33:20.331 --> 33:21.666
Looks okay to me.

33:21.749 --> 33:23.626
He's fine. I knew it.

33:25.670 --> 33:27.880
I don't understand
why he's being so stubborn?

33:27.964 --> 33:28.881
He won't come out?

33:31.509 --> 33:32.635
[sighs]

33:32.719 --> 33:34.345
He's always like this.

33:34.429 --> 33:35.722
[Dae-su] He's too stubborn.

33:38.016 --> 33:38.850
[Hyo-ryeong] Huh?

33:38.933 --> 33:40.309
[door opens]

33:42.145 --> 33:43.229
So what did he say?

33:43.312 --> 33:44.355
[Dae-su] He won't come out?

33:45.231 --> 33:47.191
He said he's staying the full hour.

33:47.275 --> 33:48.693
[sighs]
He's pissed.

33:49.777 --> 33:50.820
I'll go in.

33:50.903 --> 33:51.904
Why would you go?

33:52.947 --> 33:54.866
If anyone should, it's Na-yeon.

33:58.786 --> 33:59.704
Why should I?

34:00.288 --> 34:01.831
He's like this because of you.

34:02.373 --> 34:04.042
-[Na-yeon] What did I do?
-[Ji-min] Like you don't know?

34:04.125 --> 34:05.835
Was it wrong to suspect him?

34:05.918 --> 34:08.254
You did too. Everyone did.
It wasn't just me.

34:10.465 --> 34:12.008
I always believe him.

34:12.091 --> 34:13.051
Me too.

34:13.593 --> 34:15.887
Well, I didn't. She's right.

34:15.970 --> 34:18.181
But I didn't insult him like you did.

34:18.264 --> 34:19.849
Why are you picking on me?

34:19.932 --> 34:21.184
'Cause you deserve it.

34:21.267 --> 34:22.685
That's enough, Ji-min.

34:24.020 --> 34:24.854
[scoffs]

34:26.939 --> 34:27.774
[sighs]

34:32.195 --> 34:33.988
[Ms. Park]
You remember your promise, right?

34:34.572 --> 34:36.741
After 30 minutes you'd apologize.

34:37.700 --> 34:38.576
Okay.

34:42.830 --> 34:44.415
It's been 30 minutes.

34:46.959 --> 34:48.044
All right.

34:54.175 --> 34:55.802
[foreboding music playing]

35:32.755 --> 35:35.633
[Dae-su] She's doing it. Holy shit.
She's really doing it.

35:40.721 --> 35:41.556
Hey.

35:43.391 --> 35:44.684
I'm talking to you.

35:48.104 --> 35:49.647
You're ignoring me?

35:49.730 --> 35:50.565
[scoffs]

35:52.150 --> 35:53.109
What do you want?

35:53.192 --> 35:56.154
Oh, yo. They're talking.
That's good. Right?

35:56.237 --> 35:57.780
[Na-yeon] Why don't you answer me?

35:57.864 --> 35:59.115
Apologize and get out.

35:59.782 --> 36:00.867
How's your cut doing?

36:00.950 --> 36:02.577
Why do you care?

36:03.327 --> 36:04.370
Show me.

36:06.747 --> 36:09.584
-[Dae-su] Oh, shit. She's touching him.
-[both laughing]

36:11.085 --> 36:12.670
Well, that's pretty bold of her.

36:20.011 --> 36:24.473
[Na-yeon] I suspected you
because the situation called for it.

36:24.557 --> 36:26.851
And I was really mad earlier.

36:29.645 --> 36:31.063
I'm still mad at you.

36:32.607 --> 36:33.608
I guess…

36:34.525 --> 36:36.068
[Dae-su] She's Gyeong-su type?

36:37.320 --> 36:38.863
-[laughing]
-I have no idea.

36:40.823 --> 36:42.909
You know I've always looked down on you.

36:46.078 --> 36:49.457
It's fine. It's all in the past.
Let's just go.

36:49.540 --> 36:50.791
I'm not apologizing.

36:51.500 --> 36:53.169
You deserve to be looked down on.

36:53.711 --> 36:56.714
Our complex banned you welfies,
but you force your way in.

36:57.506 --> 36:58.925
[Na-yeon] And how dare you push me?

36:59.008 --> 37:00.551
Listen, you fucking…

37:00.635 --> 37:02.136
You thought I'd apologize?

37:02.220 --> 37:04.388
[Dae-su] Kiss, kiss.

37:04.472 --> 37:07.099
[Wu-jin chuckles]
This is so crazy.

37:07.183 --> 37:09.060
Everyone is taking your side.

37:10.561 --> 37:13.022
I was cornered
because of a nobody like you.

37:13.940 --> 37:15.316
Stay the full hour.

37:16.817 --> 37:18.653
I hope you never come out again.

37:21.322 --> 37:22.490
Fucking welfie.

37:22.573 --> 37:24.242
[Dae-su] Oh, they're coming.
They're coming.

37:24.325 --> 37:25.243
-[all applauding]
-Hey!

37:25.326 --> 37:27.870
How cute was that? So cute-- Whoa, whoa!

37:27.954 --> 37:28.829
-[Ms. Park] Gyeong-su!
-Come here you piece of--

37:28.913 --> 37:30.039
-Wait, wait, what?
-Gyeong-su, what's wrong?

37:30.122 --> 37:33.125
You're fucking…
you're such a fucking cheat.

37:33.209 --> 37:36.545
[Gyeong-su mumbling]

37:40.132 --> 37:41.008
[sighs]

37:41.884 --> 37:44.637
-I don't understand why I have to take it?
-[Ms. Park] Did you really say that?

37:44.720 --> 37:46.722
You promised me you'd apologize to him.

37:46.806 --> 37:48.849
-[Dae-su] Dude, forget about her.
-I did nothing wrong.

37:49.433 --> 37:50.851
You only think about yourself.

37:51.686 --> 37:53.938
You said to close the door
before anyone could get in.

37:54.021 --> 37:55.690
You said it would be safer for us.

37:55.773 --> 37:56.899
That's not right.

37:58.317 --> 38:01.279
We almost died
when Gyeong-su pulled Coach Kang in.

38:01.362 --> 38:02.822
[Na-yeon] Why aren't you mad at him?

38:03.906 --> 38:05.241
That was not his fault.

38:05.324 --> 38:07.243
How is he supposed to know that
that was gonna happen?

38:07.326 --> 38:10.246
-That's enough. Quiet, everyone.
-We'd be quiet if she were gone.

38:13.708 --> 38:15.418
You're all so annoying.

38:16.294 --> 38:18.087
What if I'm right about this?

38:19.171 --> 38:21.799
Then will you finally admit
I saved you all, huh?

38:21.882 --> 38:25.761
I don't understand.
How can you still be like this?

38:31.100 --> 38:32.018
Look.

38:33.728 --> 38:35.438
Guess I was right after all.

38:40.651 --> 38:42.320
[suspenseful music playing]

38:43.279 --> 38:44.363
What?

38:51.370 --> 38:52.538
Gyeong-su.

39:02.590 --> 39:04.342
[Mr. Lee] Day 26 of infection.

39:05.509 --> 39:08.137
I told you didn't I?
You still think I'm wrong?

39:08.888 --> 39:11.932
The strong cells are attacking
the hosts weak cells.

39:12.933 --> 39:15.770
Every single cell
is struggling just to survive…

39:17.938 --> 39:19.315
they're attacking each other.

39:20.024 --> 39:22.985
[Mr. Lee] This virus in essence
is like the will to live.

39:23.736 --> 39:26.322
It consumes all cells almost instantly.

39:29.367 --> 39:30.826
[breathing shakily]

39:32.244 --> 39:35.122
Hey, hey. What's wrong with me?
Something's wrong.

39:36.874 --> 39:38.000
Oh, shit.

39:39.001 --> 39:40.211
What's wrong?

39:42.129 --> 39:43.255
[Cheong-san] It's not true.

39:44.965 --> 39:47.176
Come on. Get rid of him.
Get rid of him now!

39:47.259 --> 39:49.470
-I'm not--
-Gyeong-su. Stay where you are.

39:51.138 --> 39:52.390
Stay back.

39:53.849 --> 39:55.810
I swear fucking I'm not.

39:55.893 --> 39:57.186
[breathes shakily]

39:57.269 --> 39:58.521
I'm sorry, Gyeong-su.

39:59.688 --> 40:00.981
[On-jo] Please, stay back.

40:03.984 --> 40:05.778
[shuddering]

40:08.239 --> 40:10.366
[Gyeong-su in quivering voice]
I've turned, right?

40:12.284 --> 40:13.786
Cheong-san, what do I do?

40:18.040 --> 40:21.961
No, no. This doesn't make any sense.

40:22.044 --> 40:23.212
Why would you…

40:23.295 --> 40:24.171
Cheong-san.

40:24.255 --> 40:25.089
Let go.

40:27.174 --> 40:28.759
[voice breaking]
This cannot be true.

40:29.593 --> 40:30.886
Why would you suddenly…

40:32.096 --> 40:34.348
[Mr. Lee] The infected human
feels extreme fear…

40:38.352 --> 40:40.438
and then they attack in order to survive.

40:43.482 --> 40:44.942
No, no. Gyeong-su you weren't--

40:45.025 --> 40:47.278
Stay away. Don't come any closer!

40:47.361 --> 40:48.362
[breathes shakily]

40:51.240 --> 40:52.241
[growling]

40:54.160 --> 40:55.286
[breathes shakily]

40:55.369 --> 40:56.662
[spluttering]
What are you doing?

40:56.745 --> 40:57.621
We need to kick him out.

40:58.539 --> 40:59.957
[Na-yeon] We're all gonna die!

41:00.458 --> 41:01.459
What…

41:02.501 --> 41:05.254
What's happening…

41:05.921 --> 41:07.047
Fuck.

41:08.340 --> 41:09.967
[breathing nervously]

41:12.011 --> 41:14.513
Get out. I said, get out!

41:14.597 --> 41:16.223
Shut the fuck up!

41:16.307 --> 41:17.683
I'll leave by myself.

41:18.434 --> 41:21.020
I'll leave. I'll go on my own.

41:22.021 --> 41:23.606
[Gyeong-su sobbing]
Why would I bite you?

41:23.689 --> 41:26.817
We're supposed to be fucking friends.
We're friends.

41:28.736 --> 41:31.280
If I-- If I leave,
it will be better for everyone.

41:31.864 --> 41:33.491
[Gyeong-su sobbing]

41:35.618 --> 41:37.953
Gyeong-su… why don't you just go back

41:38.037 --> 41:39.663
into the recording room
until we can figure out--

41:39.747 --> 41:40.915
If he stays in here
he's gonna kill us all.

41:40.998 --> 41:41.916
Na-yeon!

41:41.999 --> 41:43.542
I'm just trying to stay alive.

41:46.879 --> 41:48.547
[breathes heavily]

41:49.298 --> 41:50.257
I'll leave.

41:52.593 --> 41:53.886
[grunting]

42:04.355 --> 42:07.358
I'll get out of here on my own.
Don't worry.

42:07.441 --> 42:08.567
[sobbing]

42:09.068 --> 42:11.362
[Gyeong-su] I'll get out of here.

42:14.323 --> 42:15.449
Gyeong-su.

42:16.242 --> 42:18.577
It's okay.

42:19.662 --> 42:22.206
Thank you for everything.

42:24.375 --> 42:25.292
Stay alive.

42:26.669 --> 42:27.753
[Gyeong-su breathes shakily]

42:29.338 --> 42:31.757
[girls snickering]

42:33.259 --> 42:35.052
-[On-jo] Are you all right, Gyeong-su?
-Stay alive.

42:35.135 --> 42:37.263
[Ji-min snickering]
What an idiot.

42:37.346 --> 42:39.848
[girls laughing]

42:39.932 --> 42:41.892
-What are you looking at?
-[snickering]

42:41.976 --> 42:45.604
Why are you doing that?
You're scaring me. Stop,

42:45.688 --> 42:47.314
-[snickering continues]
-[Gyeong-su screams]

42:48.232 --> 42:50.776
Stop it. Cheong-san,
why are you doing this?

42:50.859 --> 42:53.028
Stop it! Please stop!

42:53.612 --> 42:55.114
[wailing]

42:57.366 --> 42:58.325
[croaks]

43:03.706 --> 43:04.707
[croaks]

43:11.547 --> 43:13.424
[growling]

43:16.844 --> 43:18.345
[breathing shakily]

43:19.805 --> 43:20.973
[growls]

43:21.974 --> 43:23.100
[intense music playing]

43:23.934 --> 43:25.436
[growling]

43:32.109 --> 43:32.943
[growling]

43:33.027 --> 43:36.071
[Cheong-san whistling
to the tune of "Auld Lang Syne"]

43:40.951 --> 43:42.911
[whistling continues]

43:47.750 --> 43:48.751
[growls]

43:50.586 --> 43:51.754
[shrieks]

43:57.176 --> 43:58.427
[growling]

43:58.510 --> 43:59.887
[breathing heavily]

44:00.888 --> 44:01.889
[growling]

44:13.484 --> 44:15.277
[sobs]

44:24.370 --> 44:26.997
[zombie growling in distance]

44:36.590 --> 44:38.092
[growling]

44:41.345 --> 44:42.846
[siren wailing in distance]

44:44.890 --> 44:46.433
[zombies growling]

44:48.811 --> 44:50.229
[baby coos]

44:51.021 --> 44:52.606
[screaming in distance]

44:53.107 --> 44:54.233
[growls]

44:55.943 --> 44:57.361
[growling]

44:58.195 --> 44:59.530
[wind chimes tinkle]

45:01.532 --> 45:03.117
[panting]

45:03.742 --> 45:04.618
[baby coos]

45:08.038 --> 45:10.541
[baby fussing]

45:12.960 --> 45:13.877
[sniffles]

45:21.385 --> 45:23.887
[screaming in distance]

45:24.388 --> 45:25.597
[sobbing]

45:29.518 --> 45:31.353
[croaks]

45:31.437 --> 45:33.772
[baby crying]

45:35.399 --> 45:40.028
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN

45:42.573 --> 45:44.575
CONGRATULATIONS
ON YOUR NEW BEGINNING

45:46.034 --> 45:47.911
[baby crying continues]

45:53.083 --> 45:54.501
[growling]

46:00.215 --> 46:01.842
[baby crying continues]

46:19.735 --> 46:21.612
[baby crying continues]

46:35.709 --> 46:37.753
[growling]

46:44.468 --> 46:45.636
[growling]

46:52.935 --> 46:53.810
-Lift it.
-Okay.

46:53.894 --> 46:54.770
Here.

46:56.104 --> 46:57.523
-[Dal-ho] One more.
-[muffled croaks]

47:04.530 --> 47:07.574
[So-ju] Fire and Disasters Headquarters
said not to touch the infected.

47:09.535 --> 47:12.371
As you can see, it's highly contagious--

47:12.454 --> 47:14.289
We were notified too, no need to explain.

47:16.542 --> 47:17.876
How long do we have to stay here?

47:18.460 --> 47:20.837
They're sending over a helicopter,
but it's gonna take time.

47:20.921 --> 47:23.006
So it looks like
you'll have to wait a bit longer.

47:25.217 --> 47:27.010
Did you notify them
that I was here as well?

47:27.094 --> 47:27.970
What?

47:29.888 --> 47:31.848
I'm asking if it's taking time
to get a chopper

47:31.932 --> 47:33.433
even though they know I'm here?

47:33.517 --> 47:35.060
No, I did not tell them who was here.

47:36.436 --> 47:37.729
You should've told them.

47:38.272 --> 47:40.023
That way, they'll send one
right away to pick us up.

47:43.277 --> 47:47.656
Per rules of rescue, the weak and ill
take priority over VIPs.

47:48.240 --> 47:52.035
We'll hear back soon,
so please be patient like everyone else.

47:54.204 --> 47:55.372
[grumbles]
Shit.

47:56.915 --> 47:58.250
[keypad clacking]

47:59.585 --> 48:00.877
ON-JO'S HOMEROOM TEACHER

48:01.545 --> 48:03.046
[phone line ringing]

48:03.130 --> 48:05.299
[chattering indistinctly]

48:07.968 --> 48:10.679
[operator] The person you have called
is currently unavailable.

48:15.350 --> 48:17.311
This is Captain Nam So-ju.

48:17.936 --> 48:20.522
If anyone knows the status
of Hyosan High School,

48:20.606 --> 48:22.399
-please respond.
-[intercom beeps, static]

48:27.738 --> 48:28.572
[intercom beeps]

48:29.114 --> 48:33.160
If anyone knows anything
about the area near Hyosan High School

48:33.243 --> 48:34.119
please respond.

48:34.202 --> 48:35.871
[intercom beeps, static]

48:35.954 --> 48:36.872
[sighs]

48:41.752 --> 48:43.045
[intercom beeps]

48:43.128 --> 48:44.296
Please respond.

48:45.380 --> 48:47.257
KOREA
RESCUE

48:55.474 --> 48:56.308
[Dae-su sniffles]

48:57.809 --> 48:59.895
That asshole.
[sobs]

49:00.562 --> 49:01.855
Gyeong-su…
[sobbing]

49:03.190 --> 49:04.983
…why did you have to turn?

49:05.067 --> 49:06.360
[crying]

49:07.861 --> 49:09.196
I told you all.

49:09.863 --> 49:10.989
He was infected.

49:11.823 --> 49:13.909
Well, are you happy now?

49:14.910 --> 49:17.579
[Na-yeon] You were all wrong.
Only I was right.

49:18.288 --> 49:20.207
What would you even do without me?

49:21.041 --> 49:22.334
Hey.

49:26.004 --> 49:26.922
Maybe you did it.

49:27.005 --> 49:28.548
What?

49:36.848 --> 49:38.141
I saw everything.

49:40.227 --> 49:41.478
Na-yeon…

49:44.231 --> 49:46.024
What? What did you see?

49:46.108 --> 49:47.275
You are the one who did it.

49:47.359 --> 49:49.111
Who did what?

49:49.194 --> 49:51.238
I didn't do anything to Gyeong-su.

49:51.321 --> 49:52.823
I didn't say anything about Gyeong-su.

49:54.116 --> 49:55.033
Knock it off.

49:55.575 --> 49:56.785
What do you talking about?

49:57.744 --> 49:58.829
I didn't do anything.

49:58.912 --> 50:02.249
While we were all watching Gyeong-su,
you were in the back alone.

50:02.749 --> 50:06.336
Ms. Park. It's been more than 30 minutes,
but he still doesn't want to come out.

50:06.420 --> 50:07.921
[foreboding music playing]

50:09.965 --> 50:11.758
[sighs]
I'll see what I can do.

50:14.136 --> 50:15.262
What's wrong with him?

50:19.766 --> 50:21.101
[Dae-su] Looks okay to me.

50:23.854 --> 50:25.397
[Hyo-ryeong]
Why is he not coming out then?

50:25.480 --> 50:26.857
[Su-hyeok] He won't come out?

50:26.940 --> 50:28.817
[Cheong-san] I don't understand
why he's being so stubborn?

50:29.609 --> 50:31.027
[Dae-su] He's too stubborn.

50:31.111 --> 50:33.071
[Cheong-san sighs]
He's always like this.

50:35.449 --> 50:37.659
You wiped that blood
with your handkerchief.

50:41.788 --> 50:43.331
No, I didn't.

50:43.415 --> 50:45.459
You wiped that
on the scratches on Gyeong-su's hand.

50:46.209 --> 50:48.670
-[Na-yeon] I did not.
-It's in your pocket.

50:48.754 --> 50:50.213
-So what?
-Take it out.

50:50.297 --> 50:51.923
-No.
-Take it out.

50:52.007 --> 50:53.008
I said no.

50:54.426 --> 50:55.761
Should I take it out?

50:55.844 --> 50:57.971
-[both grunting]
-Fuck you!

50:58.054 --> 50:59.806
Who the hell do you think you are?

50:59.890 --> 51:01.683
Class president?
[grunts]

51:02.642 --> 51:05.604
You never treated me like president.

51:05.687 --> 51:07.230
Nam-ra, that's enough.

51:10.233 --> 51:12.444
Nam-ra, do you realize
what you're saying right now?

51:13.195 --> 51:14.446
If that is true,

51:15.322 --> 51:17.699
it means Na-yeon killed Gyeong-su.

51:18.366 --> 51:19.284
[Nam-ra] It's true.

51:20.994 --> 51:22.245
Na-yeon did it.

51:24.539 --> 51:25.624
She killed him.

51:27.250 --> 51:28.335
You fucking cunt.

51:30.045 --> 51:31.338
There.

51:31.421 --> 51:32.380
Happy?

51:37.844 --> 51:38.762
This is blood.

51:38.845 --> 51:40.722
I wiped Gyeong-su's hand.

51:41.848 --> 51:43.099
This is his blood?

51:43.183 --> 51:44.768
You can't tell?

51:46.144 --> 51:47.604
Then put it on your wound.

51:50.857 --> 51:53.026
Wipe yourself with it
if you're so confident.

51:54.152 --> 51:55.904
Like his blood is so clean?

51:56.446 --> 51:57.656
He was a zombie.

51:59.533 --> 52:03.036
He was just fine until you infected him
with your handkerchief.

52:04.037 --> 52:04.996
Na-yeon, you--

52:05.080 --> 52:06.873
Damn it! It wasn't me!

52:06.957 --> 52:08.667
[Na-yeon breathing heavily]

52:12.796 --> 52:14.214
Don't do it. Stop it.

52:14.297 --> 52:15.423
Let go.

52:16.007 --> 52:17.759
-I said to stop it.
-[whimpers]

52:17.843 --> 52:18.885
Give it to me.

52:18.969 --> 52:20.846
Leave me alone! Fuck!

52:22.722 --> 52:24.474
I should just die too then, huh?

52:24.975 --> 52:26.351
That's what you want, isn't it?

52:28.562 --> 52:29.855
[sighs]

52:31.606 --> 52:32.899
[whimpers]

52:32.983 --> 52:34.901
Why is Gyeong-su better than me?

52:37.779 --> 52:39.865
That dirty welfie pushed me.

52:43.243 --> 52:45.203
Na-yeon, you didn't…

52:45.287 --> 52:48.039
So, you did do it.

52:48.123 --> 52:49.624
How could you just fucking--

52:49.708 --> 52:51.293
I didn't kill him, okay?

52:52.836 --> 52:54.921
Gyeong-su fell, but he got up and ran.

52:55.005 --> 52:57.048
[Na-yeon] He's still alive.

52:57.132 --> 52:59.134
He didn't die, he just turned.

52:59.217 --> 53:00.468
Are you kidding me right now?

53:00.552 --> 53:02.220
Stop ganging up on me.

53:03.930 --> 53:06.433
When I said he smelled, you all laughed.

53:07.017 --> 53:08.810
You all made fun of him too.

53:08.894 --> 53:10.520
Don't try to act innocent now.

53:11.354 --> 53:12.647
-Na-yeon…
-Cheong-san, stop.

53:13.315 --> 53:14.858
-How could you kill him?
-[gasps]

53:14.941 --> 53:15.859
[Ms. Park] Stop it.

53:17.819 --> 53:19.988
[breathing heavily]

53:24.117 --> 53:25.160
You're…

53:27.954 --> 53:29.164
a murderer.

53:30.498 --> 53:32.375
[whimpering]

53:33.877 --> 53:35.211
[breathes shakily]

53:44.179 --> 53:45.388
[Na-yeon sobbing]

53:53.063 --> 53:53.897
I…

53:54.940 --> 53:56.942
I have no friends at all.

53:59.110 --> 54:00.111
[Na-yeon sobbing]

54:00.195 --> 54:02.113
[Na-yeon] I don't need any of you.

54:03.365 --> 54:04.491
Fuck you.

54:06.618 --> 54:07.744
[crying]

54:08.328 --> 54:09.245
[sniffles]

54:15.919 --> 54:17.045
Hey!

54:24.177 --> 54:25.845
[somber music playing]

54:33.103 --> 54:34.062
[Ms. Park] Listen…

54:37.941 --> 54:40.360
No matter what happens, you stay alive.

54:41.903 --> 54:43.697
Also, you must never take a life.

54:43.780 --> 54:45.573
[crying]

54:49.494 --> 54:50.829
[growls]

54:51.788 --> 54:53.415
[growls, hisses]

54:54.958 --> 54:56.918
[Ms. Park] If you cause
someone else to die,

54:57.961 --> 55:00.255
life becomes completely meaningless.

55:02.799 --> 55:03.675
All right?

55:22.110 --> 55:23.820
Ms. Park! Wait.

55:24.612 --> 55:26.531
-Dae-su, don't go.
-[sobs]

55:27.073 --> 55:28.491
She's gone.

55:28.575 --> 55:29.492
[crying]

55:31.703 --> 55:33.496
[zombie growling]

55:33.580 --> 55:34.914
[ominous music playing]

55:36.249 --> 55:37.208
[sobs]

55:38.084 --> 55:39.335
[growling]

55:50.346 --> 55:51.681
[growling]

55:58.104 --> 55:59.022
Fuck!

56:08.031 --> 56:09.908
[helicopter whirring]

56:20.585 --> 56:23.088
[closing theme music]

01:00:04.142 --> 01:00:07.061
ALL CHARACTERS,
LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,

01:00:07.145 --> 01:00:10.064
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
